[{"id":3275019184,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7DNNOw","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Hrm... I'm not sure this is an improvement.\n\nEach of these macros do bind to `ClassDB`. But arguably, they bind more to `Object` because `get_class_static()` is called, which assumes that the caller is an `Object`. \n\nAt the same time, while we use `ClassDB` for registration right now, we (hopefully) won't in the future, when we'll introduce a proper core typing system. Once that happens, we will have to rewrite and move the macros to the typing header anyway.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110939#pullrequestreview-3275019184","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110939","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110939#pullrequestreview-3275019184"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110939"}},"submitted_at":"2025-09-27T16:39:21Z","commit_id":"2bafd9b16cbe